  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Motorcycle assembly and production plant in Nairobi</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Koneksie BV, a Dutch social enterprise has developed a motorcycle for the African market.The company aims to provide safe and reliable transport for all in Africa. In order to reach that goal, the motorcycle is offered in combination with driver&#x2019;s training, safety clothing and a helmet. This investment increases motorcycle production capacity in Kenya. The company will also roll out a maintenance and service network. 84 new jobs in Kenya, next to the existing 21 jobs, are created with this investment. All employees will receive training. Also, indirect jobs are created at the service providers that will maintain and service the motorcycles. 83 employees will be trained at these companies.</narrative>
  </description>
